data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "synth-2", "text": "Drafted 'polarization_splitting_optical_tweezers' on a 360x460 mm plate: 5x lens, 3x mirror, 2x pbs, 1x half wave plate, 1x dichroic, 1x vapor cell, 1x beam dump, 1x photodiode. Polarization-splitting dual-beam optical tweezers (Figure 5 of 'Optical Tweezers: A Comprehensive Tutorial from Calibration to Applications', arXiv:2004.05246). A half-wave plate (HWP1) and polarizing beamsplitter (PBS1) s"}

