data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "repair-1", "text": "Rationale: Increased the focal lengths and separation of objective O, sample stage Stage, and condenser C from 40 mm to 50 mm (and enlarged the baseplate height to 480 mm) so the 75x25 mm vapor_cell footprint of Stage no longer overlaps with the 15x25 mm lens footprints of O and C."}

